{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for the simulated device fleet.",
    "",
    "This file is consumed by three places that used to each carry their own",
    "hardcoded copy, which had already drifted apart (the frontend accepted led",
    "modes 'solid' and oven mode 'preheat' that the control Lambda rejected):",
    "  - device-simulator renders a component per entry",
    "  - cdk/lambda/iot-control validates commands against `capabilities`",
    "  - cdk/lambda/iot-discovery returns this list to the agent",
    "",
    "deviceId is the MQTT topic segment and the agent's handle for a device:",
    "  smarthome/{userSub}/{deviceId}/command   (agent -> device)",
    "  smarthome/{userSub}/{deviceId}/state     (device -> IoT rule -> DynamoDB)",
    "It is {room}-{type}-{seq} so two of the same kind stay addressable, which",
    "is what makes 'turn on the living room light' resolvable at all.",
    "",
    "capabilities drives validation. Types: boolean | integer | enum | color |",
    "segments | readonly. `integer` carries min/max and is CLAMPED rather than",
    "rejected, so 'set the fan to 20' answers 'that fan goes up to 8, set to 8'.",
    "",
    "`actions` maps a wire action name to the capability it writes. Keeping the",
    "action names lets existing skills and the voice agent's powerOn/powerOff",
    "payloads keep working.",
    "",
    "`implies` states side effects the device performs itself. 'Set the fan to 5'",
    "should make the fan run, so setSpeed implies power=true — otherwise the agent",
    "has to know to send a second command, and a UI click and an MQTT command end",
    "up behaving differently."
  ],
  "rooms": {
    "living": { "en": "Living Room", "zh": "客厅" },
    "bedroom": { "en": "Bedroom", "zh": "卧室" },
    "kitchen": { "en": "Kitchen", "zh": "厨房" }
  },
  "devices": [
    {
      "deviceId": "living-strip-1",
      "deviceType": "light_strip",
      "displayName": { "en": "Living Room Light Strip", "zh": "客厅灯带" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "brightness": { "type": "integer", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "color": { "type": "color" },
        "color_temp": { "type": "integer", "min": 2000, "max": 6500, "unit": "K" },
        "segments": { "type": "segments", "count": 30 },
        "effect": {
          "type": "enum",
          "values": ["solid", "gradient", "wave", "chase", "breathe", "sparkle", "twinkle"]
        },
        "effect_speed": { "type": "integer", "min": 1, "max": 10 }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setBrightness": { "writes": "brightness", "required": ["brightness"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColor": { "writes": "color", "required": ["color"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColorTemp": { "writes": "color_temp", "required": ["color_temp"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setEffect": {
          "writes": "effect",
          "required": ["effect"],
          "optional": ["colors", "effect_speed"],
          "params": { "colors": "segments" },
          "implies": { "power": true }
        }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "bedroom-light-1",
      "deviceType": "light",
      "displayName": { "en": "Bedroom Light", "zh": "卧室灯" },
      "room": "bedroom",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "brightness": { "type": "integer", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "color": { "type": "color" },
        "color_temp": { "type": "integer", "min": 2000, "max": 6500, "unit": "K" }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setBrightness": { "writes": "brightness", "required": ["brightness"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColor": { "writes": "color", "required": ["color"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColorTemp": { "writes": "color_temp", "required": ["color_temp"], "implies": { "power": true } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-fan-1",
      "deviceType": "fan",
      "displayName": { "en": "Living Room Fan", "zh": "客厅风扇" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "speed": { "type": "integer", "min": 0, "max": 8 },
        "mode": { "type": "enum", "values": ["normal", "natural", "sleep", "auto"] },
        "oscillation": { "type": "boolean" }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setSpeed": { "writes": "speed", "required": ["speed"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setMode": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setOscillation": {
          "writes": "oscillation",
          "required": ["enabled"],
          "params": { "enabled": "oscillation" }
        }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-plug-1",
      "deviceType": "plug",
      "displayName": { "en": "Living Room Smart Plug", "zh": "客厅智能插座" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-sensor-1",
      "deviceType": "sensor",
      "displayName": { "en": "Living Room Environment Sensor", "zh": "客厅环境传感器" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "ble",
      "$comment": "Read-only. Control actions are rejected with a query hint, which is what makes 'turn on the thermometer' answerable as 'that only reports readings — here they are'.",
      "capabilities": {
        "temperature": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "C", "min": -10, "max": 50 },
        "humidity": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "%", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "pm25": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "ug/m3", "min": 0, "max": 500 },
        "co2": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "ppm", "min": 400, "max": 5000 }
      },
      "actions": {}
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-led-1",
      "deviceType": "led_matrix",
      "displayName": { "en": "LED Matrix", "zh": "LED 点阵屏" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "$comment": "Pre-existing device. Kept because skills, docs and the voice agent's all-devices loop reference it. 'solid' is in the enum now — the frontend always supported it while the control Lambda rejected it.",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "brightness": { "type": "integer", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "color": { "type": "color" },
        "mode": {
          "type": "enum",
          "values": ["rainbow", "breathing", "chase", "sparkle", "fire", "ocean", "aurora", "solid"]
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setMode": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setBrightness": { "writes": "brightness", "required": ["brightness"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColor": { "writes": "color", "required": ["color"], "implies": { "power": true } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "kitchen-cooker-1",
      "deviceType": "rice_cooker",
      "displayName": { "en": "Rice Cooker", "zh": "电饭煲" },
      "room": "kitchen",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "cooking": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mode": {
          "type": "enum",
          "values": ["white_rice", "brown_rice", "porridge", "steam"]
        },
        "keep_warm": { "type": "boolean" }
      },
      "actions": {
        "start": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "cooking": true } },
        "stop": { "writes": "cooking", "required": [], "implies": { "cooking": false } },
        "keepWarm": {
          "writes": "keep_warm",
          "required": ["enabled"],
          "params": { "enabled": "keep_warm" }
        }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "start", "mode": "white_rice" },
      "powerOff": { "action": "stop" }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "bedroom-humidifier-1",
      "deviceType": "humidifier",
      "displayName": { "en": "Bedroom Humidifier", "zh": "卧室加湿器" },
      "room": "bedroom",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mist_level": { "type": "integer", "min": 1, "max": 5 },
        "mode": { "type": "enum", "values": ["continuous", "intermittent", "sleep", "auto"] },
        "target_humidity": { "type": "integer", "min": 30, "max": 80, "unit": "%" },
        "water_level": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "%", "min": 0, "max": 100 }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setMistLevel": { "writes": "mist_level", "required": ["mist_level"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setMode": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setTargetHumidity": { "writes": "target_humidity", "required": ["target_humidity"], "implies": { "power": true } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-purifier-1",
      "deviceType": "air_purifier",
      "displayName": { "en": "Living Room Air Purifier", "zh": "客厅空气净化器" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "$comment": "filter_life is read-only so 'when do I change the filter' is answerable, and it is the kind of maintenance reading an agent should surface rather than set.",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "fan_speed": { "type": "integer", "min": 1, "max": 5 },
        "mode": { "type": "enum", "values": ["auto", "sleep", "turbo", "manual"] },
        "child_lock": { "type": "boolean" },
        "filter_life": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "%", "min": 0, "max": 100 }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setFanSpeed": { "writes": "fan_speed", "required": ["fan_speed"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setMode": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setChildLock": { "writes": "child_lock", "required": ["enabled"], "params": { "enabled": "child_lock" } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "kitchen-icemaker-1",
      "deviceType": "ice_maker",
      "displayName": { "en": "Ice Maker", "zh": "制冰机" },
      "room": "kitchen",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "$comment": "The requirements name 'start making ice' explicitly, hence startIce/stopIce rather than a bare power toggle.",
      "capabilities": {
        "making_ice": { "type": "boolean" },
        "ice_size": { "type": "enum", "values": ["small", "medium", "large"] },
        "bin_level": { "type": "readonly", "unit": "%", "min": 0, "max": 100 }
      },
      "actions": {
        "startIce": { "writes": "making_ice", "required": [], "implies": { "making_ice": true } },
        "stopIce": { "writes": "making_ice", "required": [], "implies": { "making_ice": false } },
        "setIceSize": { "writes": "ice_size", "required": ["ice_size"] }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "startIce" },
      "powerOff": { "action": "stopIce" }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "living-tvlight-1",
      "deviceType": "tv_light",
      "displayName": { "en": "TV Backlight", "zh": "电视背光灯" },
      "room": "living",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "$comment": "The screen-sync master for the video-sync scene. Zones map to the four screen edges, so a 4-segment addressable light; sync_mode is driven by the scene-sync agent, which waits on `bluetooth` before claiming music sync is running.",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "brightness": { "type": "integer", "min": 0, "max": 100 },
        "color": { "type": "color" },
        "segments": { "type": "segments", "count": 4 },
        "effect": {
          "type": "enum",
          "values": ["solid", "gradient", "wave", "chase", "breathe", "sparkle", "twinkle"]
        },
        "effect_speed": { "type": "integer", "min": 1, "max": 10 },
        "sync_mode": { "type": "enum", "values": ["off", "video", "music"] },
        "bluetooth": {
          "type": "readonly",
          "values": ["idle", "pairing", "connected"],
          "$comment": "Reported by the simulator, never settable. Music sync goes over the speaker link, so the scene-sync agent polls this instead of assuming the pairing succeeded — 'paired in a moment' and 'never paired' look identical for the first two seconds."
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setBrightness": { "writes": "brightness", "required": ["brightness"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setColor": { "writes": "color", "required": ["color"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setEffect": {
          "writes": "effect",
          "required": ["effect"],
          "optional": ["colors", "effect_speed"],
          "params": { "colors": "segments" },
          "implies": { "power": true }
        },
        "setSyncMode": { "writes": "sync_mode", "required": ["sync_mode"], "implies": { "power": true } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    },
    {
      "deviceId": "kitchen-oven-1",
      "deviceType": "oven",
      "displayName": { "en": "Oven", "zh": "烤箱" },
      "room": "kitchen",
      "connectivity": "wifi",
      "$comment": "'preheat' is in the enum now — same frontend/Lambda drift as led_matrix's 'solid'.",
      "capabilities": {
        "power": { "type": "boolean" },
        "mode": {
          "type": "enum",
          "values": ["bake", "broil", "convection", "preheat"]
        },
        "temperature": { "type": "integer", "min": 200, "max": 500, "unit": "F" }
      },
      "actions": {
        "setPower": { "writes": "power", "required": ["power"] },
        "setMode": { "writes": "mode", "required": ["mode"], "implies": { "power": true } },
        "setTemperature": { "writes": "temperature", "required": ["temperature"], "implies": { "power": true } }
      },
      "powerOn": { "action": "setPower", "power": true },
      "powerOff": { "action": "setPower", "power": false }
    }
  ]
}
